[node name="Room04" type="Node2D"]
editor_description = "1) Gust (Z) the crate right twice so it lands on the plate: door A opens. 2) Gust the windmill, then jump and dash across the spike pit before gate B closes (4 s; the ring shows the time left). The pit is dead air: no gliding. 3) Stand on the leaf and gust to ride it up, then jump to the exit ledge."
